# Marketing site build-time env (set these in the Vercel "stayvia-marketing"
# project → Settings → Environment Variables, Production).
#
# The landing page bakes this at build time to point every "Start free trial"
# / "Sign in" CTA at the product app. Vite only reads VITE_* vars.

# Where the product app lives (the app moved to the app.* subdomain).
VITE_APP_URL=https://app.stayvia.infynarc.com
